  <releases>
    <release version="__VERSION__" date="__DATE__">
      <description>
        <ul>
          <li>A file playing at a different speed, such as a PAL version, now has its imported tracks kept in sync: the audio is resampled to the speed of the main video, pitch included, and the subtitles are stretched</li>
          <li>The video shows a Loading status with the details and the progress while a file is loaded and its audio offset measured, instead of a spinner in the tracks</li>
          <li>A new Muxing queue, shown in the status bar, handles the preparation of the imported tracks and the cutting and joining of the video parts, with their progress</li>
          <li>The imported tracks now get their compression settings like the other tracks</li>
          <li>An error occurring while processing a video is now displayed instead of nothing happening, and the Process button can no longer be used a second time while the steps follow each other</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
  </releases>
